tion data. Each object then serves as the source of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"information about a single map annotation and provides critical information,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"such as the annotation’s location on the map. Annotation objects do not provide"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the visual representation of the annotation but typically coordinate (in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"conjunction with the map view’s delegate) the creation of an appropriate"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"objects to handle the display."}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNMapViewDelegate/mapView:calloutViewForAnnotation:":{"title":"mapView:calloutViewForAnnotation:","fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"mapView:calloutViewForAnnotation:"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapViewDelegate\/mapView:calloutViewForAnnotation:","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns a callout view to display for the given annotation."}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmapviewdelegate\/mapview:calloutviewforannotation:","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol"}}}